    },
    {
      "text": "What if we focused on open-source models that can be run locally? What if we focused on building a harness that is so good that we can get the performance of a cutting-edge model through a local open-source model?",
      "timestamp_sec": 52,
      "why": "The talk's central hypothesis in one sentence."
    },
    {
      "text": "So, scores range from 52.4% to 76.2%. So, more than a 20-point difference, and only the harness changed.",
