    },
    {
      "text": "Often when agents get confused and fail, it's because they have too much context blow, but also because they have too many unrelated concepts in their context.",
      "timestamp_sec": 1485,
      "why": "A specific failure-mode diagnosis others may dispute."
    },
    {
      "text": "So the baseline objective is 0.2 and it's going to try to improve upon that.",
      "timestamp_sec": 1580,
